cp-help-debug = Segzi amek i yettwanɣal ufaylu. Yessermad -v daɣen
cp-help-verbose = Ini-d s wudem aflalay ayen i yettwaxedmen
cp-help-symbolic-link = Snulfu-d iseɣwan izamulen deg umḍiq n unɣal
cp-help-force = Ma ur yezmir ara ad yeldi ufaylu n tɣerwaḍt yellan, kkes-it sakin ɛreḍ tikkelt nniḍen (taxtiṛt-a tettwazgel ma tettwaseqdac daɣen textiṛt -n). Ur tettwaselkem ara akka tura i Windows.
cp-help-remove-destination = Kkes yal afaylu n tɣerwaḍt yellan uqbel ad tɛerḍeḍ ad t-teldiḍ (yemgarad ɣef --force). Deg Windows, akka tura, tettmahil kan i yifuyla i deg tezmer ad taruḍ.
cp-help-attributes-only = Ur nɣel ara isefka n ufaylu, anagar imyaren
cp-help-preserve = Ḥrez imyaren yettwabedren (s wudem amezwer: askar, bab d ugraw n ufaylu (Unix kan), izemzakuden), akked yimyaren imernan ma yella wamek: asatal, iseɣwan, xattr, meṛṛa
cp-help-preserve-default = D agdazal n --preserve=mode,ownership(Unix kan),timestamps
cp-help-no-preserve = Ur ḥrez ara imyaren yettwabedren
cp-help-parents = Seqdec isem ummid n ufaylu n uɣbalu ddaw UKARAM
cp-help-no-dereference = Ur ḍeffeṛ ara akk iseɣwan izamulen deg UƔBALU
